      "start": "00:00:00.000",
      "text": " A few weeks ago, I met Emily."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:11.970",
      "start": "00:00:06.965",
      "text": " This wonderful, elegant person."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:13.972",
      "start": "00:00:11.970",
      "text": " Our sons brought us together, actually."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:15.974",
      "start": "00:00:13.972",
      "text": " Come here a little dude."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:17.976",
      "start": "00:00:15.974",
      "text": " Come here, now, how's our play date today?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:18.977",
      "start": "00:00:17.976",
      "text": " The drink?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:20.979",
      "start": "00:00:18.977",
      "text": " Does our catch rain?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:21.980",
      "start": "00:00:20.979",
      "text": " Hi, Mike."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:23.982",
      "start": "00:00:21.980",
      "text": " Oh, it's time for tour later."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:24.983",
      "start": "00:00:23.982",
      "text": " Let's start tasting."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:25.984",
      "start": "00:00:24.983",
      "text": " I think you're joking, but great."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:27.986",
      "start": "00:00:25.984",
      "text": " Shut up, my personal bougie."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:29.988",
      "start": "00:00:27.986",
      "text": " Every time we do this, I feel so high-town."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:31.990",
      "start": "00:00:29.988",
      "text": " I feel my face is chilled, ain't me."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:32.991",
      "start": "00:00:31.990",
      "text": " Want to trade confessions?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:33.992",
      "start": "00:00:32.991",
      "text": " No, no, no."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:34.993",
      "start": "00:00:33.992",
      "text": " Come on."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:35.994",
      "start": "00:00:34.993",
      "text": " That's the world's thing you've ever done."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:37.996",
      "start": "00:00:35.994",
      "text": " She isn't a nightmare, my wife."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:38.997",
      "start": "00:00:37.996",
      "text": " You can get closer."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:39.998",
      "start": "00:00:38.997",
      "text": " You can have a quick readure."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:42.960",
      "start": "00:00:39.998",
      "text": " She's like a beautiful ghost."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:44.962",
      "start": "00:00:42.960",
      "text": " Did you just take my picture?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:45.963",
      "start": "00:00:44.962",
      "text": " You're right, Seth."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:46.964",
      "start": "00:00:45.963",
      "text": " I guess I'm probably not the kind of person"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:47.965",
      "start": "00:00:46.964",
      "text": " you're normally friends with."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:49.967",
      "start": "00:00:47.965",
      "text": " Oh, you do not want to be friends with me."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:50.968",
      "start": "00:00:49.967",
      "text": " Trust me."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:54.972",
      "start": "00:00:52.970",
      "text": " Stephanie, I need your help."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:55.973",
      "start": "00:00:54.972",
      "text": " Are you okay?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:58.976",
      "start": "00:00:55.973",
      "text": " I'm fine, but I do need just a simple favor."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:59.977",
      "start": "00:00:58.976",
      "text": " Can you promote her?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:00.978",
      "start": "00:00:59.977",
      "text": " Yeah."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:04.982",
      "start": "00:01:02.980",
      "text": " Five days ago, Emily went missing."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:11.989",
      "start": "00:01:10.988",
      "text": " I warned you."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:13.991",
      "start": "00:01:11.989",
      "text": " You go poking around in her past"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:15.993",
      "start": "00:01:13.991",
      "text": " and you're going to find something that is terrifying."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:18.996",
      "start": "00:01:15.993",
      "text": " She was not a normal person like you or me."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:23.000",
      "start": "00:01:18.996",
      "text": " I've never seen such a beautiful girl."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:24.960",
      "start": "00:01:23.000",
      "text": " I want to be so invisible."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:27.963",
      "start": "00:01:25.961",
      "text": " I smell her, Sean."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:29.965",
      "start": "00:01:27.963",
      "text": " I smell her perfume like a ghost."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:31.967",
      "start": "00:01:29.965",
      "text": " I have to keep being paranoid."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:33.969",
      "start": "00:01:31.967",
      "text": " It's on my mind."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:36.972",
      "start": "00:01:34.970",
      "text": " She told me she had Stephanie."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:49.985",
      "start": "00:01:46.982",
      "text": " Were you aware that he took out an extra $4 million"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:52.988",
      "start": "00:01:49.985",
      "text": " of life insurance policy on Emily before she disappeared?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:55.991",
      "start": "00:01:52.988",
      "text": " People do terrible things for their own reasons."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:58.994",
      "start": "00:01:55.991",
      "text": " They thought you knew more than you were letting off."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:05.000",
      "start": "00:02:03.999",
      "text": " Oh, I made a secret."
    }
  ],
